 camera feed support for Android and Windows.\r\n- Also improved camera support for MacOS, which should work on iOS as well.\r\n- Instead of one camera feed per device, CameraServer now creates a feed per device/format/size. This way you can easily query CameraServer for the most appropriate feed based on its orientation, data format and size.\r\n- Added example project using shaders to render camera feed.\r\n\r\n**MovieWriter**\r\n- Added support for OGV audio/video recording to MovieWriter.\r\n- Tested on MacBook M3 with good results (30 fps with 720p).\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- *Production edit: This may supersede https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/49763.*","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":311852125,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTE4NTIxMjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20work","name":"needs work","description":"","color":"cc9999","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","description":"","color":"ff7766","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for 